# Villa Umo Dewi

## Cara Install di Local

1. Clone repository
\\\bash
git clone https://github.com/ekomplitz/villa-umo-dewi.git
cd villa-umo-dewi
\\\

2. Install dependencies
\\\bash
composer install
\\\

3. Copy .env
\\\bash
copy .env.example .env
\\\
(atau buat file .env manual)

4. Generate key
\\\bash
php artisan key:generate
\\\

5. Setup database di file .env, lalu migrate
\\\bash
php artisan migrate
\\\

6. Jalankan server
\\\bash
php artisan serve
\\\

## Fitur
- Booking bungalow (B1: Rp250.000, B2-4: Rp500.000)
- Check-in / Check-out dengan hitung durasi
- Dark mode & Light mode
- Bahasa Indonesia & Inggris
- Responsive mobile

